{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN PAGE SECTION - STATIC PAGE CONTENT DISPLAY
  =============================================================================
  Simple page content section for displaying static page information
  - Renders page title and content from Shopify admin
  - Responsive layout with centered content container
  - Rich text editor (RTE) support for formatted content
  - Staggered animations for enhanced user experience
  - Minimal configuration with focus on content display
  - Used for About Us, Contact, Policies, and other static pages
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  PAGE CONTAINER & LAYOUT
  =============================================================================
  Main page container with responsive layout and spacing
  - central: Centers content within page width constraints
  - content: Applies consistent content styling
  - py-medium: Vertical padding for proper spacing
  - Responsive design that adapts to different screen sizes
{% endcomment %}
<div class="central content py-medium">
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    PAGE TITLE DISPLAY
    =============================================================================
    Page heading with consistent styling and animation
    - feature-header: Consistent heading styling across theme
    - page.title: Page title from Shopify admin settings
    - data-cc-animate: JavaScript animation trigger for entrance effects
    - H1 tag for proper page hierarchy and SEO
  {% endcomment %}
  <h1 class="feature-header" data-cc-animate>{{ page.title }}</h1>

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    PAGE CONTENT RENDERING
    =============================================================================
    Rich text content area with enhanced styling and animations
    - rte: Rich text editor styling for consistent typography
    - page.content: Page content from Shopify admin (supports HTML)
    - data-cc-animate: Animation hook for content appearance
    - data-cc-animate-delay="0.2s": Staggered animation timing
    - Supports formatted text, images, links, and basic HTML
  {% endcomment %}
  <div class="rte" data-cc-animate data-cc-animate-delay="0.2s">
    {{ page.content }}
  </div>
</div>

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  PAGE SECTION SCHEMA - CONFIGURATION & CUSTOMIZATION
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for page section
  - name: Section name displayed in theme editor
  - Minimal configuration for simple page content display
  - No additional settings required for basic functionality
  - Automatically added to page templates
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Page"
}
{% endschema %}
